// A bud vase as a Voronoi web on a plate of its own: one distance field of engine nodes, its wall
// cut into even cells between a solid foot and a solid collar.
use mod.fab.*

script("voronoi_vase.cad.splash")

color("Teal", rgb: #x2a9d8f)

place("voronoi_vase", at: [175mm 160mm], name: "Voronoi vase", color: "Teal")
